			<item>
				<title>Tim Hortons in Valencia</title>
				<link>https://miroadamy.com/posts/2019-06-23-tim-hortons/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 23 Jun 2019 11:22:48 +0800</pubDate>
				<guid>https://miroadamy.com/posts/2019-06-23-tim-hortons/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;I have my doubts whether it will survive. It is next to Starbucks (one of several, albeit nothing like Toronto) so there is competition for tourists looking for the familiar logo.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;As for locals, Spanish coffee culture is quite different, and if I am allowed to say so - Spanish coffee is both better AND less expensive as&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;So let&amp;rsquo;s hope Timbits will save the day. Who could resist deep fried sugary dough, eh ?&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
